          {
            "description": "Caminho do arquivo JSON alvo. Aceita caminho absoluto dentro de /storage/emulated/0/Documents/CDXMS_Solutions ou relativo ao base_path. Exemplos: core/settings.json; capabilities/json_config_manager/config.json; capabilities/mdf/components.json; /storage/emulated/0/Documents/CDXMS_Solutions/core/registry.json. Obrigatório em read_json, exists, write_json, merge_json, ensure_file, backup_file e delete_file.",
